  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Thinly slice brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Cut tomato into wedges. Cut zucchini into rounds. Cut lemon into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bb2fb087e74f1041b218c2-76fd29d1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 3-4 mins.\n• Stir in herby tomato seasoning, the stock powder, water and arborio rice. Bring to the boil, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bb2fb087e74f1041b218c2-4d259f11.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto to a large baking dish.\n• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is 'al dente', 24-28 mins.\n• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tomato and zucchini, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bb2fb087e74f1041b218c2-32cfba89.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir Parmesan cheese, the butter, a squeeze of lemon juice and the baby spinach through risotto until spinach has wilted. Add a splash of water to loosen if needed.\n• Gently stir through veggies. Season to taste.\n• Divide risotto between bowls. Sprinkle with a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) and flaked almonds.\n• Serve with lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bb2fb087e74f1041b218c2-dc4bf040.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
